{2}{You have found some clues.It seems that the evil lord  NeverWinter Mainmoduler is responsible.Your only way of escaping is to find the 5 rings of power.}
{3}{You have killed the first boss.You have found the elite +1 ring of power.You must now find the elite +2 ring of power.}
{4}{You have killed the second boss.You have found the elite +2 ring of power.You must now find the elite +3 ring of power.}
{5}{You have killed the third boss.You have found the elite +3 ring of power.You must now find the elite +4 ring of power.}
{6}{You have killed the fourth boss.You have found the elite +4 ring of power.You must now face Miss NeverWinter Mainmoduler and  her sidekick Moulournz.Get the vorpal ring of power.}
{7}{You have killed the final boss.You have found the vorpal ring of power.Game over sucker.}
{8}{Having finished the game, it seems you've figured out a way to prolong your role-playing experience.  Good Luck to you!}
